d":"21105","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"61534","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"280327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"15104","synopsis":"Hey, there! I’m Shougo, from the band CRUSHERZ. Pleased to meet you--WISH! These past few days, my little brother Izumi (who’s the most adorable thing in the universe) has been pretty down due to a certain incident. The instigator of this incident was Ryouma Ichijou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i6GNf42jrIEKu2ObN8zghToKrEy.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Hey, there! I’m Shougo, from the band CRUSHERZ. Pleased to meet you--WISH! These past few days, my little brother Izumi (who’s the most adorable thing in the universe) has been pretty down due to a certain incident. The instigator of this incident was Ryouma Ichijou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i6GNf42jrIEKu2ObN8zghToKrEy.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9906","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20520","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21105","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"61534","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"280327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"15102","synopsis":"Hello, Izumi here! So Ryouma and I are now texting buddies, but he keeps sending me a mountain of texts every day. Worse, he even showed up at my college--give me a break! (cries) But now’s not the time for me to get bogged down by something like that--the deadline for the Kadoyama Manga Prize is coming up!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3qL3jl00av0XnafTs9f2rJi5S4L.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Hello, Izumi here! So Ryouma and I are now texting buddies, but he keeps sending me a mountain of texts every day. Worse, he even showed up at my college--give me a break! (cries) But now’s not the time for me to get bogged down by something like that--the deadline for the Kadoyama Manga Prize is coming up!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3qL3jl00av0XnafTs9f2rJi5S4L.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9906","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20520","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21105","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"61534","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"280327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"15099","synopsis":"This is Sagara of Sena Productions once again. A... truly troubling situation has arisen. It seems some paparazzi photos of Izumi-san and Ichijou Ryouma are scheduled to appear in a gossip magazine. Though in a way, this could be an excellent opportunity to have Izumi-san make his show business debut!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yQq1Pee8AXW7sImKSp8jyF3OhUk.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"This is Sagara of Sena Productions once again. A... truly troubling situation has arisen. It seems some paparazzi photos of Izumi-san and Ichijou Ryouma are scheduled to appear in a gossip magazine. Though in a way, this could be an excellent opportunity to have Izumi-san make his show business debut!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yQq1Pee8AXW7sImKSp8jyF3OhUk.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9906","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20520","episodeNumber